    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh wow i didnt realize it was that serious. i was worried i'd have to stop eating basically everything i like. are there any other high protein or 'healthy' foods i should be looking for that are safe? like maybe more stuff like greek yogurt or eggs or certain tofu brands? i just want a list of things i can actually enjoy so i dont feel like im on a restricted diet while i'm feeling down.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Greek yogurt and eggs are generally excellent, safe choices for protein intake while on an MAOI. Tofu is also a great option, provided it is fresh and not aged. Focus on lean meats, poultry, and fresh, unprocessed vegetables to keep your diet balanced and safe. Remember, consistency with your medication and diet is key to managing your mood effectively.",
      "source": "target",
