      "content": "thanks that helps! i'm also a bit of a foodie so i love fermented stuff. would it be totally fine to have some kombucha or maybe some kimchi if i use fresh ingredients? i feel like those are really healthy for my gut and i dont want to miss out on those probiotics while i'm on this med.",
